{
  "id": "LEV.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Abalawi 17",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amachiiko igoro y’amanyinga e ching’iti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Teebia Aroni na abamura baye amo n’Abaisraeli bonsi ng’a inche Omonene nachiikire iga:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto onde bwensi okonyenyera eng’ombe, gose emaanwa y’eng’ondi, gose embori, ase egetwori, gose isiko y’egetwori,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atayerenteti agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano ebe ekeng’wanso ase ’nde, bosio bw’Obomenyo bwane, rirorio okomocha kw’ogoitera amanyinga nakobarerwe omonto oyio. Ere oiteire amanyinga, ase igo naatananwe korwa ase abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Abaisraeli tibakonyara gokora buna baarenge gokora agwo ritang’ani, tibakonyenyera ching’iti chi’ebing’wanso biabo orosana isiko; goika bachindetere inche Omonene, bachiire ase Omokuani agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano, bachinyeenyereo chibe ebing’wanso bi’omorembe ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Omokuani asiarere amanyinga ase egesasiimero kiane agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano, naende asaambe ebitinya bibe rimisu rigiya rikongwenera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli tibaabaisa konyenyera ebing’wanso biabo isiko aande na kobirua ase ebirecha, na igo babe abatari abegenwa ase ’nde. Oyio nobe omooroberio ochikiire oragenderere botaambe, ebiaare ase ebiaare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase igo obateebie ng’a monto onde bwensi ase Abaisraeli, gose omomenyi omenyete ase egati yabo, kararue ekeng’wanso kegosaambwa ekegima, gose ekeng’wanso kende gionsi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na omonto oyio atakerenteti ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano na gokerua ase ’nde, nigo araatananwe korwa ase abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onde bwensi ase Abaisraeli, gose omomenyi omenyete ase egati yabo, oraarie amanyinga ande onsi, inche Omonene nimbe mamincha y’omonto oyio, na inche nimwatanane korwa ase abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obomoyo bwa kera omobere nigo bore ime ase amanyinga; nabaeire amanyinga moyanyororokererie ase egesasiimero akore okobwatanigwa ase obomoyo bwaino; amanyinga naro agokora okobwatanigwa, ekiagera obomoyo bore imeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio natebirie Abaisraeli ng’a monto onde bwensi obo, gose omomenyi omenyete ase egati yabo, tabaisa koria amanyinga ande onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto onde bwensi ase Abaisraeli, gose omomenyi omenyete ase egati yabo, oraite eng’iti y’orosana, gose enyoni eyancheire koriegwa, goika aitere amanyinga aye inse, erio ayatube amaroba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obomoyo bwa kera omobere nigo bore ase amanyinga. Ase engencho eyio nateebirie Abaisraeli ng’a tibaria amanyinga y’eng’iti ende yonsi, ekiagera obomoyo bwa kera egetongwa nigo bore ase amanyinga aye. Omonto onde bwensi oraarie amanyinga nigo araatananwe korwa ase abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto onde bwensi, omobiare gose omomenyi omenyete ase egati yaino, oraarie eng’iti ekwete yoka enyene, gose eyeitire ne ching’iti chinde chi’orosana, goika asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache; nabe oyotachenegeti goika omogoroba oyio, erio abe ochenekire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye tagosibia chianga chiaye na gwesibia omobere, rirorio nabogorie obobe bwaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
